### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### 硬件评估
GET http://localhost:8000/hardware/profile

### 创建会议
POST http://localhost:8000/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "示例联调会议",
  "language": "zh"
}

### 上传音频并转写
POST http://localhost:8000/meetings/demo-meeting/transcribe
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="sample.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./sample.wav
--boundary--

### 实时上传音频块并获取字幕
POST http://localhost:8000/meetings/demo-meeting/transcribe/chunk?offset=0
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="chunk.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./chunk.wav
--boundary--

### 获取会议列表
GET http://localhost:8000/meetings

### 下载 Markdown 摘要
GET http://localhost:8000/meetings/demo-meeting/summary
